Adapted on October 29, 2026:
- app.scss theme tokens and base controls, with local font import paths.
- Panel.svelte, retained as the shared surface component.
- Navbar/Base.svelte layout, adapted to the OCR upload/extract/settings actions.
- Uploader.svelte layout, adapted to the OCR queue and accepted file types.
- The home-page layout, shortened to the OCR tool.
- Host Grotesk webfonts and background SVG.

The modified application's source is provided through the Source code link in
the interface and can be regenerated with npm run source. Font assets retain
their separate SIL Open Font License notices. VERT's name and logo are not used
as this application's identity.
